  "decides": "Feedback is of kind comment, change_request or validated and records author, time, target record version and kind at admission; a posted entry is never edited, a correction is a new entry linking back to the original, and revoking access never rewrites past attribution. Validated feedback is attributed to an exact record version, never changes that record's approval state, and never satisfies a separation-of-duties, approval or independent-review requirement.",
